name: roaming_partner_traffic
title: "Roaming partner traffic"
description: "Revenue assurance: which partner operators exchange roaming traffic, how much, and where the charges look wrong. Each link is the roaming records between two operators for one event type and settlement status; a thicker link means more records. Advanced search sums the charges per pair: the Northwind Mobile to Aurora Telecom data link is billed at 3.2 times the agreed rate. Cut points shows the Quartz and Fjord backbone."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: circular
profile: telecom
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: roaming_tap_dataset
    sourceCol: SENDER_NAME
    targetCol: RECIPIENT_NAME
    linkKindCol: EVENT_TYPE
    attrCols[1]: SETTLEMENT_STATUS
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
